@bgm respite volume:0.7
@back bg_squareDay.Crossfade pos:50,50 scale:1 time:1.5 wait!
@sfx crowd volume:0.3 !wait
NA: You continue walking, and little by little the sound of voices grows — mixed with the clinking of metal, footsteps, street calls.
NA: Buildings come into view: stone houses, packed-earth roads, people moving back and forth.
@char AL.neutral look:left pos:{leftmid}
@char {PLAYER}.neutral look:left pos:{rightmid}
AL: Vila Rica. Loud, suspicious… and full of people with more ideas than sense.
NA: He gestures ahead. You walk a little farther until you reach a pleasant, well-kept house.
@stopSfx fade:3 !wait
NA: Alvarenga dismounts with ease and ties the horse to a nearby post. Then he approaches the door and bends down to remove his boots.
AL: My wife dislikes it when I come in with dirty boots. She’ll complain until she runs out of breath.
NA: He gives you a sideways glance, almost conspiratorial.
@char AL.thinking look:left pos:{leftmid}
AL: I’d appreciate it if you did the same.
NA: You lower your gaze to your feet — one dusty sneaker… the other only a sock.
@char {PLAYER}.embarrass look:left pos:{rightmid}
PLAYER: Sure.
NA: As you remove what remains of your shoe, an awkward silence settles in.

@hide MainBackground
@back bg_squareDay.Crossfade pos:-55,90 scale:2.5 time:1 wait!
; AQUI

NA: He then opens the wooden door and invites you inside.
NA: The house is well cared for — wood beams, whitewashed walls, the scent of recently prepared food.
NA: Alvarenga gestures with his hand.
AL: Wait here a moment. I’ll be right back.
@hide AL
@char {PLAYER}.neutral look:left pos:{mid}
NA: You nod. While waiting, your curious eyes wander around the room: a neatly set table, wooden furniture, utensils worn by use, small portraits and objects you don’t recognize.
NA: Everything feels… far too old. Any detail could be a clue.
NA: Something to confirm what time you’re truly in.
NA: Footsteps approach.
@char AL.thinking look:left pos:{leftmid}
NA: Alvarenga returns carrying folded clothes in his arms.

@char {PLAYER}.surprise look:left pos:{rightmid}
AL: I believe these will fit you.
NA: He indicates a small room nearby and steps away, clearly giving you privacy.
@back bg_black.Crossfade pos:50,50 scale:1 time:0
@gosub .BlackScreen
NA: You enter and close the door behind you.
NA: You change clothes carefully. The fabric is rough, unlike what you’re used to. When you look at yourself, you barely recognize the reflection — now you seem to belong to this place, even without knowing how or why.


@sfx clothes volume:0.5
@wait 1.0
