AL: Are you hungry?
NA: Your stomach answers before you even think to speak.
@sfx hungry
@char AL.smile look:left pos:{leftmid}
AL: I thought so. The market is still lively at this hour. If we go now, we avoid the worst of the chaos.
NA: He takes a small cloth bundle and tucks it close to his body.
@char AL.neutral look:left pos:{leftmid}
