FR: We’ll talk properly tomorrow.
FR: Vila Rica takes its toll on everyone… but it doesn’t close its doors to those willing to work.
@hide FR
@char AL.neutral look:left pos:{mid}.
; NA: Alvarenga steps closer, lowering his voice.
