; Cena 5H- 1-Rota da Hipolita
# Rota_Estrada
@stopBgm fade:3 !wait
@set rotaEstrada=true
NA: Not quite sure where you’re going, you follow the packed dirt road, the sun weighing heavy on your shoulders.
@back bg_gardenDay.Crossfade time:1.5 wait!
@bgm hipolita volume:0.7
NA: In the distance, a large manor stands out — grand, almost like a country estate.
NA: Beside it, a carefully maintained garden arranged in European fashion, sharply contrasting with everything around it.
PLAYER: (Well… the definition of “multifunctional” just got updated…)
NA: You try not to stare too much, but curiosity wins. Your steps carry you closer.
NA: Among the garden plants, a woman moves with careful precision.
